SY_TALK("Lsy0rTtLtxM",[[85,["I bow to all the seekers of truth"]],[100,["When we say we are seeking, we must know that","we are a special category of people."]],[114,["People were seeking before also."]],[118,["They were seeking power, money, possessions,","affluence, every sort of thing."]],[129,["Still they are not satisfied - those who have","got it."]],[138,["And so those who are seeking the truth are","the highest, highest of all in the evolution."]],[149,["They are the ones who are going to jump into","that higher state which is called as self-realization."]],[160,["If you are not seeking, then nobody can force","seeking on you."]],[167,["It cannot be done."]],[170,["Even by force, if you take somebody to the","beautiful lake of nectar of God's love and"]],[180,["even if you force the person to drink it,","it is you who has to enjoy it and unless and"]],[187,["until you have the seeking, you will not have","the sensitivity to enjoy that nectar."]],[191,["And truth is what it is."]],[197,["We cannot change it, we cannot organize it,","we cannot transform it."]],[204,["It is, it has been, it will be."]],[210,["And what is the truth?"]],[212,["The truth is that God loves us, that His divine","power of love is all-pervading, is everywhere,"]],[225,["that this power is acting all the time - it","is a living power of a living God - and that"]],[233,["this power does all the things that we call","as living work of God."]],[239,["A flower is transformed into a fruit by this","power."]],[244,["This body we get out of that power."]],[247,["From amoeba to this stage we have come out","of that power."]],[251,["The whole world is created out of that power."]],[254,["In everything that power resides and works","out, sorts out, co-ordinates things for us."]],[263,["Above all, it is the love of God."]],[266,["It's the compassion of God."]],[268,["We human beings have not got the comprehension","of His love; we try to see Him through our"]],[279,["own angles, through our short sight, through","our blinkers that we have got."]],[285,["He is the ocean, ocean of love."]],[288,["All the oceans put together cannot be compared","with that ocean of love, that ocean of forgiveness,"]],[295,["an ocean of complete well-being for us."]],[299,["Only thing, we have to jump into it."]],[304,["We have to enter into His kingdom."]],[309,["That is what one has to do."]],[313,["When it is accomplished, then you are just","there."]],[316,["You are looked after."]],[319,["That is the domain of God I am talking about","and there, when you enter in, as a by-product,"]],[326,["all kinds of well-being are blessed upon you,","just they are bestowed upon you."]],[334,["You just get them automatically."]],[337,["But this happening also is not our doing."]],[342,["This also is the doing of God."]],[345,["He has arranged us in this way that you can","see in the chart - this is the life tree - or"]],[352,["you (can) say the tree of life as described."]],[355,["And this is the one that is within us already","placed."]],[358,["All these centers, which are subtle centers,","are expressed outside as gross centers."]],[370,["When this residual force of Kundalini, which","people must have explained to you, from that"]],[376,["sacred bone or sacrum rises and pierces through","all these centers, it enlightens all of them"]],[383,["one by one."]],[385,["By that enlightenment only, you get your physical","well-being, your mental well-being, your emotional"]],[392,["well-being and ultimately, your spiritual","well being."]],[396,["That means you become the spirit."]],[398,["Once you become that absolute, the absolute,","then all relativity drops off."]],[404,["We actually live in a relative world which","is false, which is not true."]],[409,["This power has its own telecommunication."]],[414,["It's so tremendous that it is unbelievable","that such a power exists around us and we"]],[420,["are not aware of it."]],[422,["We are not aware of many things."]],[424,["We are not aware that this Mother Earth is","moving with such a tremendous speed."]],[428,["We are standing on top of that; nothing happens","to you."]],[431,["We are not aware of the gravity."]],[433,["We are not aware of many things because God","is so kind, so gentle and so thoughtful that"]],[441,["He wants us to live happily as human beings."]],[445,["So He doesn't want us to hear some things","which are not good for us, for our ears, so"]],[454,["He makes the frequency of these things so","sharp that we can't hear with these ears."]],[458,["Some of them, He makes them so low that you","can't hear."]],[464,["Only what you can hear and enjoy He makes","you hear."]],[467,["But we in our freedom have done a lot of wrong","to ourselves, to each other, to our society,"]],[474,["to the whole world."]],[476,["Once we realize, this freedom is nothing but","is our ego, our ego, which has created this"]],[488,["problem for all other people."]],[492,["Then we have also another thing where we get","conditioned, which creates the superego."]],[497,["Now in our activity, which is the right side","sympathetic nervous system, we accumulate"]],[503,["this horrible thing called ego, because when","we act, we think we are doing it, we are in-charge."]],[509,["We are not."]],[511,["He is in charge."]],[513,["We are really doing nothing."]],[516,["What are we doing?"]],[518,["Like the people ask me, \"Mother how can you","cure everything so easily?\""]],[525,["It's simple."]],[527,["How do you make a flower into a fruit?"]],[528,["To us, we take it for granted."]],[530,["We are not bothered to find out, but can you","do it?"]],[533,["It's so difficult."]],[534,["Can you do it?"]],[536,["We can't."]],[539,["But if it is God's power, it can do it."]],[541,["So if you also have the God's power flowing","in you, which will happen to you as soon as"]],[547,["you get your realization, you can do it; anybody","can do it."]],[551,["It's very simple."]],[552,["Like any instrument, when it is put to the","mains, it starts acting and then we can see"]],[557,["that it is an instrument."]],[559,["Otherwise it looks like some funny stuff here."]],[563,["It has to be put to the mains."]],[565,["The instrument is ready, but within us these","two things, called the ego and superego as"]],[570,["a result of our activity and as a result of","our conditioning, are accumulated in our brain."]],[576,["These two are to be sucked in."]],[580,["That's very important because when they grow,","these two elements - or two, we can, say balloon-like"]],[588,["structures - they make a very strong gap filled","with calcium and you become an egg."]],[600,["Another becomes an egg."]],[601,["Third person becomes an egg."]],[603,["You develop your I-ness - I am this, I am","that."]],[608,["All kinds of misidentifications start coming","on us."]],[615,["When this is to be sucked, what should we","do?"]],[620,["That's the question."]],[622,["What are we to do?"]],[623,["To raise the Kundalini."]],[625,["As I said, it is a living process and you","cannot do any living work - so just can't"]],[631,["do it."]],[632,["It is as simple as that."]],[633,["You yourself can't do it."]],[636,["But somebody who is enlightened, who is the","light, can enlighten another light, because"]],[643,["that light is ready, just ready, but you need","an enlightened light to enlighten that light."]],[649,["Once that light is enlightened, that light","can enlighten another light."]],[652,["But the problem is when the light which is","enlightened tries to say that \"You are to"]],[657,["be enlightened,\" immediately you hit that","person."]],[659,["You don't like it because ego is there, which","is ignorance."]],[664,["That's how people like Christ were crucified."]],[666,["What wrong did He do to people except that,","see, He said, \"I am the light?\""]],[671,["It's true."]],[672,["He was the light."]],[673,["No doubt that He was the son of God."]],[675,["It's true, He was the son of God which you","can prove - on vibrations."]],[680,["By this Sahaja Yoga, you can prove it what","He was."]],[684,["He was that, but that time people killed Him."]],[687,["Why?"]],[688,["Only because He said, \"I am the light,\" and","that you were to be enlightened by Him."]],[692,["You allowed him to live only for four years,","and when He was killed, when He was crucified,"]],[699,["you took advantage out of that and made all","kinds of artificial things out of it."]],[704,["He could not explain many things which He","talked."]],[707,["He could not say anything."]],[710,["On the cross He said, \"It has been accomplished.\""]],[713,["What has been accomplished?"]],[715,["Nobody thinks about it - what has been accomplished."]],[717,["So we have to take reference from other people,","those who have been deeper than us, who have"]],[724,["gone into it, who have found out certain things","about Christ."]],[728,["And they say that Christ accomplished the","greatest thing, the greatest feat, because"]],[734,["He was nothing but Omkara."]],[737,["He was nothing but the vibrations."]],[740,["That's why He had no body and only He could","accomplish it."]],[745,["And what did He do?"]],[746,["Is to accomplish Himself on this cross where","we have this ego and superego."]],[753,["Of course they say that He said he died for","our sins."]],[754,["How did He die for our sins?"]],[755,["We say that He died for our sins."]],[760,["We accept it, yes, because Churches are telling,","people are telling, Bible is telling."]],[765,["But how?"]],[766,["He suffered for us."]],[767,["Then why are we suffering?"]],[770,["But when He said, \"You are to be born again,\"","we don't pay any attention to that."]],[774,["For that you have found out an escape."]],[776,["You take your child to the church and they","put some water artificially and you accept,"]],[784,["\"All right, we are born again.\""]],[786,["I met people who are certified born again."]],[789,["They quarrel with me and fought with me for","nothing at all."]],[792,["I said, \"How are you born again?"]],[795,["If you are born again, that means an egg becomes","a bird."]],[799,["Have you become something different?"]],[801,["Is there any transformation in you?"]],[805,["How do you believe?"]],[806,["Why are you so self-opinionated?"]],[807,["If you are born again, what happens to you?"]],[812,["What happens to you?"]],[813,["What is born again in you?\""]],[814,["Born again is nothing but the Kundalini awakening,","which rises on top of your head and here is"]],[822,["the seat of your Spirit."]],[824,["Of course, it resides in your heart, but the","seat of the Spirit is here, and once it touches"]],[829,["that seat, immediately you start feeling that","subtle thing which is all-pervading within"]],[834,["you."]],[835,["For the first time you feel this cool breeze","of the Holy Ghost."]],[838,["Holy Ghost is nothing but the power of God,","the power of His love, which is called as"]],[846,["Adi Shakti in Sanskrit language."]],[849,["We don't have to accept anything else from","outside, any dictionary we don't have to accept"]],[855,["to give answers to things, to mysteries that","we have been suffering all these days."]],[861,["Once this cross, which is between the ego","and superego is enlightened, Christ is awakened"]],[873,["there."]],[874,["He sucks in both these things, your karmas,","your actions and your conditionings, your"]],[881,["sins."]],[882,["It is sucked in."]],[883,["There is no more for you to suffer."]],[886,["Why do you want to suffer?"]],[888,["Some people have started another theory that","we must suffer if we have to go to Christ."]],[893,["Why?"]],[894,["Did He not suffer for you sufficiently?"]],[897,["Did He not do that?"]],[898,["He has done it, then why suffer?"]],[900,["Be joyous that He established himself there","at that point."]],[904,["In the Hindu scriptures, He is called as Maha","Vishnu."]],[910,["But if I tell this to them that this was Christ,","they won't believe Me."]],[913,["If I tell this to Christians, they won't believe","Me."]],[916,["They don't want to believe it because for","them Christ is their contract."]],[919,["They have a contract with Christ, as if they","are the contractors of Christ."]],[924,["Nobody dare say anything about Christ."]],[925,["It's only they who are the Christians, and","they who are the Hindus, they who are the"]],[930,["Sikhs, they who are the Muslims and they don't","know anything about reality."]],[936,["Just fighting morning till evening in the","name of God, the One who is the ocean of love,"]],[942,["compassion and bliss."]],[945,["They are so disturbed, so upset, so violent","that one can easily see there is nowhere the"]],[955,["blessings of God."]],[957,["There is no blissful state."]],[959,["There is no peace in them."]],[961,["Because there is no peace within, how can","you have the peace without?"]],[967,["And this is what it is that one should understand","- that in the name of God, many things have"]],[972,["been done which are absolutely against it."]],[974,["They are anti-God activities because if you","become a fanatic, you are anti-God, absolutely"]],[979,["anti-God."]],[980,["You have to see that God exists for the whole","universe."]],[986,["Nobody can take His contract and can organize","it."]],[991,["When I say this, of course there will be people","who are interested in things with which they"]],[996,["are identified."]],[997,["They want to carry on with that kind of identification;","maybe they get some money out of it, maybe"]],[1003,["some sort of a name or something free."]],[1005,["But what is most important is your Spirit."]],[1008,["Why identify with anything else but your own","spirit?"]],[1012,["You cannot get money out of it."]],[1014,["No."]],[1015,["The joy of Spirit is the reward of Spirit."]],[1017,["Why do you want money?"]],[1018,["Why do you want fame for it?"]],[1022,["Why do you want anything of these worldly","things that are so transitory, temporary,"]],[1027,["will finish off?"]],[1028,["Why not ask for something that is eternal?"]],[1031,["Why not ask for the eternal life of Spirit?"]],[1034,["And that if you ask, it is at your door steps,","you can get it."]],[1038,["It's very simple and easy."]],[1040,["When you say it is simple, people can't understand."]],[1042,["They think, \"How can it be?"]],[1044,["You have to stand on your head for one life","then you have to stand on one leg for one"]],[1049,["life.\""]],[1050,["That's the idea they have got about Christ."]],[1051,["There is no need to do that - Christ has done","it for you."]],[1055,["Believe me, He has done it."]],[1058,["So now, how to understand it is simple?"]],[1062,["In this room, say, there are so many lights","and we all can see each other."]],[1065,["The room is enlightened."]],[1068,["But what did you do?"]],[1069,["You just switched on one switch, very simple."]],[1074,["If you ask anybody, \"How do I put the light","on?\""]],[1075,["I just put."]],[1076,["There is a light there."]],[1078,["Just switch on."]],[1079,["That's how you get the light."]],[1081,["But for a person who has never seen electricity,","it must be a wonder."]],[1085,["How just switching on light, so simple."]],[1087,["It is not in a way."]],[1089,["It is made simple for you, but there is a","big organization behind it."]],[1094,["There is a big history behind it and there","are so many people who are working it out."]],[1099,["There is a big machinery."]],[1103,["In the same way, whatever looks so simple","to us is tremendous, is great."]],[1108,["But God Almighty with His care and tenderness","doesn't want you to know anything about it."]],[1116,["Forget it."]],[1117,["You just jump into it."]],[1120,["You just enter into the kingdom of God and","enjoy the bliss, that's all."]],[1123,["Why do you want to bother about these things?"]],[1125,["Of course, as we are very thought-oriented,","people want to know about it."]],[1131,["That's why one has to talk about these things."]],[1135,["But best is to get your enlightenment first","and then talk of it."]],[1144,["It's a headache to talk about the electricity","and about its history, where it enters and"]],[1151,["the problems they have had and then after","all these when you have tumbled down, fallen"]],[1156,["down, everybody hit each other, kicked each","other, then say, \"All right, now it's very"]],[1161,["simple."]],[1162,["Just put on the light.\""]],[1164,["It's better to be other way round, that I","say, \"All right, put on the light, and then"]],[1167,["we'll talk about it.\""]],[1169,["I am so happy to see so many people in Cambridge","today, really very happy because I have been"]],[1175,["here before also."]],[1177,["But we had no response."]],[1179,["I was surprised."]],[1180,["Here where there are many false gurus are","working out their tricks."]],[1185,["People have collected thousands of pounds","from this place, Cambridge, which is the seat"]],[1190,["of learning."]],[1191,["Here so many educated people live, intelligent","people live - have been befooled completely"]],[1198,["and have been pampered."]],[1200,["Their ego has been pampered."]],[1202,["They have gone into such trips which are very","dangerous."]],[1207,["We had somebody from Cambridge in Sahaja Yoga,","very well educated person, got into epilepsy,"]],[1214,["going to such a horrible fellow."]],[1216,["Lost all his money, everything, bankrupt and","also epileptic."]],[1221,["Educated, very well educated, first class","boy, ruined for his life."]],[1227,["But why it happens to us, we must think."]],[1233,["Why we are enamored by such people?"]],[1235,["Because we believe in the superficial thing;","because it is being advertised in such a way."]],[1241,["These people come with a circus because they","have to attract you."]],[1245,["They have to attract you for their purses."]],[1247,["They have to attract you for their own powers","because they want that people should be dominated"]],[1253,["by them because they can extract money."]],[1256,["Their interests are very low, base and we","don't see it."]],[1262,["We don't understand it."]],[1263,["They pamper our ego."]],[1264,["They talk of big things, \"We are going to","make you a minister."]],[1267,["We are going to do this.\""]],[1269,["We say, \"All right.\""]],[1271,["We follow all this nonsense."]],[1274,["Imagine."]],[1275,["This ego is such a tricky thing."]],[1277,["It plays tricks not only with others but plays","with yourself also."]],[1282,["It cheats you."]],[1283,["The so-called intelligence of the ego can","cheat you and that's how many people are lost."]],[1288,["Those who are seekers of ages are lost because","these horrible satanic forces know how to"]],[1294,["play the trick, how to play the trick with","you and how to take you to their own domain"]],[1303,["of satanic forces by which they could extract","all your blood."]],[1307,["I am so sorry when I hear that these things","have been happening all over."]],[1312,["But in the places where there has been the","seat of love, the Goddess Saraswati reigns,"]],[1318,["where people educate themselves, all these","thing have come slowly and settled down."]],[1327,["There are other things also which are very","dangerous."]],[1330,["Like people who are, call themselves, psychologists."]],[1332,["They can be very dangerous people."]],[1334,["They are unauthorized."]],[1336,["They have no idea about the psyche."]],[1338,["They don't know that psyche also has another","side, which is the right side, which is the"]],[1343,["ego."]],[1344,["They can be very dangerously placed - person","like Freud."]],[1346,["I don't know how people believe in him."]],[1349,["In England, there are so many Freudians."]],[1351,["I am surprised because I used to think that","at least English are the wisest among all"]],[1355,["the Europeans."]],[1357,["But more than the place where he was born","and worked out in Vienna, there are more in"]],[1363,["England."]],[1364,["It is most surprising, what has happened to","our wisdom."]],[1367,["Even logically we can see that he was a hopeless","case."]],[1372,["First of all, he had bad relations with his","mother."]],[1376,["Can you imagine?"]],[1377,["He had no sublimity of any kind."]],[1378,["He was worse than an animal."]],[1379,["And secondly that he died of cancer in such","a miserable condition."]],[1383,["And he was nothing but a miserable personality."]],[1386,["How can you follow a man like that blindfolded","because he suggested that you are a sex point."]],[1395,["All your relations are based on sex."]],[1396,["There is nothing sublime."]],[1397,["Now see where is the sex point."]],[1399,["It is the last - here there is the red - and","here resides the innocence."]],[1404,["This first center, which is the innocence","within us, is the child within us, is looking"]],[1411,["after the Mother Kundalini that you have."]],[1413,["She is your Mother."]],[1414,["Everybody has their own Mother settled down","in their sacrum bone, so sweetly, waiting"]],[1418,["for an opportunity to get this realization."]],[1420,["She is going to give you your second birth","and she is going to work it out and this innocence"]],[1426,["of yours which you may kill any amount, it's","still there and they attack that innocence."]],[1432,["Today I find in all the western countries","there is a big attack coming on their innocence,"]],[1437,["on the children."]],[1438,["They do not understand that there is - sex","has nothing to do with your evolution."]],[1444,["It is not important for your evolution."]],[1446,["Of course a married sex which is a sensible","sex, which has a sanction with the collective,"]],[1452,["is very important, no doubt, for the society","and everything."]],[1456,["But here if you play about with your sex,","it's a dangerous game."]],[1459,["It gives you all kinds of diseases; it gives","you impotency, all sorts of other problems"]],[1465,["and worst of all, insecurity in the whole","atmosphere especially for the children."]],[1472,["This is what it is."]],[1473,["We have not been able to use our brains."]],[1476,["Use your brains."]],[1477,["God has given you brains, come to logical","conclusion."]],[1480,["Like the Mayor yesterday asked me, \"What do","you do with them?\""]],[1483,["I said, \"First I will bring them to logical","conclusion.\""]],[1486,["See what should we expect."]],[1489,["We have known that Christ has said that, it","is written, \"Thou shall not commit adultery.\""]],[1496,["I say, \"Thou shall not have adulterous eyes.\""]],[1499,["Are we Christians aware of these warnings?"]],[1504,["Not to have adulterous eyes, just the opposite","we have."]],[1508,["So that the eyes should be clean."]],[1511,["There should be no lust in our eyes."]],[1515,["It is to be at that point, not at the eye","level, not at the brain level."]],[1519,["It is at that point and it should reside there."]],[1524,["There is placed your innocence, because innocence","guards you against all wrong doings, all wrong"]],[1530,["things that you do with your sex, and that's","how you get into troubles and you have problems."]],[1535,["Yesterday we had people there, many people","came and as the radio fellow has told me that"]],[1543,["you better talk about how you cure people."]],[1545,["They will be very much interested."]],[1547,["I told them all how it happens and we did","cure so many people there, of many problems"]],[1552,["and so many things can be cured and if you","want , you can get My tape to know about them,"]],[1561,["how it happens and what chakras give you this."]],[1564,["But in short I'll tell you how we develop","problems within ourselves."]],[1567,["Now one thing I would say, that when I am","discussing this, human mind is so funny that"]],[1574,["immediately they start reflecting upon themselves."]],[1576,["Firstly they will feel guilty."]],[1578,["\"Oh, I have done this\"."]],[1581,["Immediately they will start thinking that,","\"I have got cancer,\" or, \"I have got leukemia,\""]],[1584,["or \"I have got that.\""]],[1585,["So if I tell you about the symptoms, it can","be very critical."]],[1589,["There is a very interesting book I read long","time back when I was a child, \"Three Men in"]],[1593,["a Boat.\""]],[1594,["I am sure all of you must have read it."]],[1596,["It's a very interesting one."]],[1597,["In that a character of one gentleman who said","that never read Materia Medica, the book about"]],[1606,["medicine."]],[1607,["Once he read it and he thought he had every","disease, every disease except for housewife's"]],[1617,["knee and the doctor was amazed when he told","he has this disease, he has that disease."]],[1624,["He said, \"Why not a housewife's knee?\""]],[1626,["He said, \"Because I am not a housewife.\""]],[1628,["Otherwise he had practically every disease","and he wanted a medicine for that."]],[1632,["doctor was - that time doctors were wiser","I think, he didn't want to take money out"]],[1637,["of him - so he said, \"All right, I have given","you the medicine but you have to take it when"]],[1644,["you go away from here."]],[1645,["Go to your bedroom and then you can take this","medicine.\""]],[1650,["He went home and opened that and there was","nothing but a paper, and on the paper it was"]],[1656,["written, \"You are the greatest fool I have","ever come across."]],[1660,["Never read Materia Medica again and you are","absolutely healthy.\""]],[1666,["So when you start telling them how the diseases","are caused, also people can start thinking,"]],[1672,["\"Oh, I must be having this trouble and that","trouble.\""]],[1674,["Nothing of the kind."]],[1675,["Please don't think like that."]],[1677,["I am just telling you because you should not","go into it again and it should not happen"]],[1682,["to you in future, not in the past."]],[1684,["And those who have had problems also can be","cured."]],[1687,["It's not difficult."]],[1688,["It can be cured."]],[1689,["When you get your enlightenment, you can cure","people."]],[1693,["You can also cure."]],[1694,["It's not difficult."]],[1696,["So, now we start from the imbalances that","we have."]],[1700,["For example, a human being has another funny","habit - is to go to extremes."]],[1704,["If you tell him, now in the Newspapers or,","say, in the TV it appears that your legs should"]],[1712,["be like this, the measurement of the legs","appear, or the measurement of the body appears,"]],[1719,["all the ladies will try to be that, to become","like the form that is given."]],[1725,["But why?"]],[1726,["It is, it might be some sort of an enterprise","that people are trying to sell something just"]],[1731,["to make you thin or fat or whatever it is","and that's why they are publishing these things."]],[1737,["Why just you go into it headlong?"]],[1738,["May not be required at all for you."]],[1741,["Now when they do it, they do it so much, so","much overdo it that they develop really the"]],[1748,["problems which never existed in them .They","were normal people and suddenly they become"]],[1752,["sick people."]],[1753,["So in this way, we have so many extremes we","go to."]],[1757,["For example, we are people who are right-sided","and left-sided as you can see here, the people"]],[1764,["who are emotionally very rich and who go to","the emotional extremes and the people who"]],[1770,["are more mentally rich and who go to the mental","side more."]],[1775,["Those who have any desire and just work with","their desires and weep for it and they are"]],[1781,["the most unhappy and the most miserable people","- I couldn't get this and I couldn't get that"]],[1787,["- they are the left-sided people."]],[1789,["The right-sided people are that \"Why did he","get that?\""]],[1791,["\"I must also get it.\""]],[1794,["Such aggressive people are right-sided."]],[1797,["Now the people who are on the left hand side","think of their past, \"I was so very happy."]],[1801,["Now I have married this wretched man and I","am very weak.\""]],[1804,["The man will say, \"I have married this wretched","woman,\" or some sort of a thing."]],[1809,["They go on worrying about themselves for nothing","at all and making themselves miserable."]],[1812,["So, we have two types of people."]],[1814,["The another, one extreme case we can say,","is Hitler."]],[1817,["Hitler was the one who was so aggressive."]],[1819,["He used his aggressive policies."]],[1820,["He got people who were dead who were aggressive","and used them to entice, to become aggressive."]],[1828,["They could not see through."]],[1829,["They could not understand that they are not","a special race and they became such racists"]],[1835,["which one can't understand with Human understanding","that how can there be a race superiority when"]],[1839,["God has created all of us."]],[1841,["It's nonsense."]],[1842,["It's absolute nonsense."]],[1843,["It has no meaning, no basis."]],[1845,["It's not natural."]],[1846,["God has created everybody separately in a","different way but this kind of a thing comes"]],[1850,["into the mind."]],[1851,["Then you are identified with certain ideas","on the right hand side that you are an aggressive"]],[1857,["person."]],[1858,["On the left hand side, as I told you, a person","makes himself miserable because he thinks"]],[1860,["of the past, but on the right hand side, the","people make others miserable and aggressive"]],[1866,["sort of."]],[1867,["Both sides are wrong."]],[1868,["You have to be in the center, neither in the","future, nor in the past."]],[1872,["So how to be in the center is the problem."]],[1874,["By saying it or by brain-washing it, it cannot","happen."]],[1876,["For that the Kundalini has to rise but you","have to keep the balance."]],[1880,["You shouldn't go to the extreme of anything."]],[1883,["You should not become identified or clubbed","with something which is not normal."]],[1888,["We should treat it with normalcy about it."]],[1892,["Like if you ask a person now, \"You have to","do Hatha Yoga\" There is a new system that"]],[1899,["has started, Hatha Yoga, without knowing what","this Hatha Yoga is."]],[1903,["What was the basis of Hatha Yoga?"]],[1904,["There are Ashtangas and all these things have","to be done."]],[1906,["I have seen people doing only that little","part of it, the Vayayama, which is so indiscriminate,"]],[1911,["which has no sense as to what chakras are","catching, where is the Kundalini, what is"]],[1915,["the problem."]],[1916,["Such people can develop heart problems, tremendous","heart problems they can develop, and they"]],[1922,["can be extremely negative people because though","they appear to be very positive, they can"]],[1928,["be very, very dry."]],[1929,["They can develop divorces."]],[1930,["They can be very aggressive."]],[1932,["A time will come when they will have no emotions."]],[1935,["Even when their own child dies, they will","not feel it."]],[1938,["They can be very, very dry."]],[1940,["Now we don't see that dryness in the back."]],[1943,["We do not see that that we are not feeling","the emotions of another person."]],[1947,["We do not think that that is important."]],[1952,["Left-sided people are the other way round,","as I told you."]],[1955,["But when they go to the extreme, first they","go into their subconscious."]],[1960,["In this they see what had happened and they","think of their previous lives and all that"]],[1964,["and then they can go into the collective sub-conscious","if they go on pressing it too much."]],[1968,["Or some of the people who are interested in","their purse, all such base things, can entice"]],[1972,["them, can hypnotize them, completely hypnotize","them and push them on to the left side."]],[1978,["Now cancer develops on the left side."]],[1982,["Leukemia develops from the left side."]],[1985,["Multiple sclerosis develops from the left","side."]],[1987,["I haven't seen one patient who has come to","me, who is having cancer, having leukemia"]],[1994,["or multiple sclerosis who is a right-sided","person."]],[1999,["And ultimately they can be epileptic, or they","can become lunatic or schizophrenic."]],[2007,["All those things can happen to them."]],[2009,["The right-sided person, on the contrary, will","get a heart attack."]],[2014,["He'll get a heart attack."]],[2015,["Definitely he'll get a heart attack, if he","goes too much with it."]],[2019,["But first of all he might develop a liver,","very bad liver, hot temper with it."]],[2023,["He may develop a pancreas trouble that could","be the diabetes."]],[2027,["He could develop the spleen trouble which","could be a kind of a leukemia which comes"]],[2033,["out of speediness but it has to triggered","by the left side so it is between the - first"]],[2041,["the anemia and all that will happen and ultimately","he can get leukemia after that."]],[2046,["And many children also become patients of","leukemia because their parents are speedy."]],[2052,["Extremely speedy people get leukemia because","they are all the time acting on emergency."]],[2059,["Simultaneously, they are working on various","things like, you are driving, you are eating,"]],[2063,["you are listening to the radio - horrid news."]],[2066,["Early in the morning you see in the newspaper,","all horrid thing are there."]],[2071,["They will never give a good news."]],[2072,["You'll be amazed."]],[2073,["We have been trying to tell people that we","have found out solutions to many things - please"]],[2077,["publish at least one line, half a line - but","they would not."]],[2082,["But if there is a calamity somewhere, a horrible","thing happened, early in the morning, you"]],[2085,["open the newspaper, it's the only thing that","is talked of."]],[2088,["You become so much upset that emergencies","that..."]],[2091,["Then you have your breakfast, you have to","catch the train, you have to rush up, you"]],[2096,["rush up, then you find that your train is","delayed, you start shouting."]],[2099,["Specially you all get worked up."]],[2101,["Ultimately what happens is that your spleen","goes out of gear."]],[2105,["It becomes crazy."]],[2106,["When it becomes crazy - it's a speedometer","- it controls our speed and you become so"]],[2111,["speedy that nothing can fit into you and the","speed of the production of red blood corpuscles"]],[2118,["is so much increased that they become malignant."]],[2120,["But of course the triggering, as I said, comes","from the left side."]],[2125,["So sometimes the right side can create a condition","for the left side to act - can also be just"]],[2135,["the left side can work out."]],[2136,["If a person is affected, say, by a position,","if he lives near a funeral place or some place"]],[2146,["where there is a cemetery or in the churches","also you have all the dead bodies there - I"]],[2153,["mean it's something I can't understand."]],[2155,["People don't know about that."]],[2156,["Why to put in the churches, the dead bodies?"]],[2160,["I mean, normally, anybody who dies must be","cremated except for the realized souls."]],[2166,["Realized souls are to be buried."]],[2168,["It's a simple thing, because they give fragrance","to the Mother Earth, they give fragrance to"]],[2172,["everyone."]],[2173,["But if you bury a person who is not a realized","soul - supposing he is an evil genius - you"]],[2178,["know about this that the souls wander about."]],[2181,["And I have lived, since I have come to London,","always near a church."]],[2185,["I have found all these souls coming up in","the night and they are horrible things and"]],[2190,["we walk over them."]],[2191,["They are sleeping there and we trod on them."]],[2193,["It's a wrong thing."]],[2194,["People have no idea as to how to deal with","the dead and that's how people have also created"]],[2199,["a double problem."]],[2200,["The cemetery is in the city."]],[2205,["The center of the city, there will be a cemetery."]],[2208,["All children are going there."]],[2209,["Everybody is going there."]],[2210,["Pregnant women are going there and these busy","bodies can attack you."]],[2212,["It's a fact."]],[2213,["They exist."]],[2214,["There is no doubt about it."]],[2215,["Even the doctors say that there are proteins","which they call as Protein 52 and Protein"]],[2222,["58, like that, and these are the proteins","which invade us, our being by which cancer"]],[2228,["is triggered."]],[2229,["And what they say that this comes to us from","an area which is built within us since our"]],[2233,["creation, means from collective sub-conscious."]],[2235,["But, I mean, they cannot put it together as","I am putting it because they see things from"]],[2240,["outside (and) I see things from inside."]],[2241,["Now when I tell about this, people don't like","it but it's a fact."]],[2246,["You should not play about with spirits."]],[2248,["These spiritualists, these charismatics and","this sect and that sect..., Penticostals are"]],[2252,["nothing but possessions and these possessions","can be horrible and most of the lunatics and"]],[2257,["all these people are with possessions."]],[2261,["You must have seen a woman walking."]],[2262,["Suddenly she becomes blank."]],[2264,["Her eyes are open, nothing wrong with her."]],[2266,["Doctors can't cure."]],[2267,["She can be easily cured if you can remove","the possession from her."]],[2271,["These are all horrible things, which can ruin","your life and you do not understand why doctors"]],[2278,["cannot understand because they don't understand","that there can be spirits."]],[2281,["They don't want to accept it."]],[2282,["You can't see the spirit until and unless","you become a Spirit."]],[2287,["That is the problem, is that in English language","there are three meanings of the word spirit."]],[2293,["One is the Spirit that is Atma."]],[2296,["Another is the spirit which is dead and the","one that you drink is also spirit."]],[2303,["So you can understand how can you have three","words, which are just opposite each other"]],[2307,["meaning the same?"]],[2308,["Now I am praying (to) the Spirit which is","in the heart, which is the reflection of God"]],[2315,["almighty."]],[2316,["But this Spirit, unless and until it is awakened,","no use talking about it."]],[2323,["Better have it done so that you know how beautiful","you are, how God has created you with such"]],[2330,["beauty, care, and you are all there intact."]],[2332,["Nothing is missing."]],[2333,["You don't have to worry about it."]],[2335,["You just don't have to think about it."]],[2337,["\"Oh, Mother, how can I be?"]],[2338,["I have done this."]],[2340,["I have done that.\""]],[2341,["Please don't think."]],[2342,["First thing that I always say before starting","the program, before the demonstration of it"]],[2344,["or before the manifestation of it, that first","of all say in your heart of hearts, \"Mother,"]],[2349,["I am not guilty.\""]],[2350,["That's one thing, this idea that you are guilty,","is absurd."]],[2356,["It has no meaning at all."]],[2358,["It is not even a speck in that Ocean which","cleanses you."]],[2362,["So you don't have to say that - that, \"I am","guilty.\""]],[2365,["Please, for heaven's sake, all of you have","to say that in your hearts before we start"]],[2369,["any program further."]],[2371,["Because how can you be guilty?"]],[2375,["As He is the compassion - you can't imagine","what compassion He has."]],[2381,["He is forgiving."]],[2383,["He is complete forgiveness."]],[2386,["At that time if you have to feel guilty, you","really insult His power of forgiveness."]],[2391,["So we should not feel guilty about anything."]],[2395,["Whatever has happened has happened."]],[2396,["Forget the past, doesn't matter."]],[2397,["It is a very important time, important moment","you have arrived."]],[2401,["The time of resurrection has come."]],[2403,["The time of blossom has come."]],[2405,["You have to become the truth."]],[2407,["It has to work out and it will work out."]],[2411,["May God bless you all."]],[2413,["I would request you, if you have any questions,","you can ask me questions."]],[2417,["But don't ask irrelevant questions and, you","see, offensive questions."]],[2421,["That's very wrong because, you see, I have","nothing to get out of you - nothing I tell"]],[2427,["you - except that little politics about it","that I am a Capitalist in the sense that I"]],[2432,["have all the powers within myself and I am","a Communist because I can't live without sharing"]],[2437,["it."]],[2438,["That's the problem and that's why I am here","and so people should not ask questions which"]],[2442,["are offensive for nothing at all."]],[2445,["If you want to get it, you can get it."]],[2446,["I cannot force you as I have told you in the","very beginning."]],[2450,["It cannot be forced."]],[2451,["I cannot promise you."]],[2452,["I am sure it will work out, if you little","bit co-operate with me."]],[2458,["So be kind to yourself and be open."]],[2461,["You need not have blind faith about me, not","at all, not at all, but you should be open"]],[2466,["to receive."]],[2467,["If it works, well and good."]],[2468,["If it doesn't work we'll see it the next time,","doesn't matter."]],[2471,["I am going to be in London at least for three","years more."]],[2478,["I hope so."]],[2482,["May God bless you all."]],[2489,["Now please ask me some questions."]],[2498,["Q. When you say that spiritualists ....spirits","are wrong..is it wrong for someone who knows"]],[2503,["the secret to try and do something about it","....what is so wrong with it?"]],[2518,["Shri Mataji: You see the spirits are the dead","spirits, are the people who belong to another"]],[2526,["country."]],[2527,["They belong to another state."]],[2528,["All right?"]],[2529,["They are in the subconscious area."]],[2532,["If you start allowing them to walk into our","lives, there will be many who will come around"]],[2536,["as immigrants, you see."]],[2537,["And you don't know what they are up to and","they will attack you."]],[2543,["Moreover, those people who are realized souls","or of higher nature never stay back."]],[2550,["They know that this is over and we should","go back."]],[2554,["Moreover, it is our responsibility also to","see that we do not trouble them."]],[2558,["I mean, we have used them; they have lived","with us."]],[2561,["Now we should give them their freedom."]],[2563,["By keeping them around, we torture them."]],[2566,["We trouble them."]],[2568,["And sometimes they can be very, very troubled."]],[2571,["Even if they are good people, we really trouble","them."]],[2573,["Let them go."]],[2574,["That's not the time that they should be here","and they will be back again."]],[2579,["Why trouble them?"]],[2580,["It is because you are identified with them."]],[2583,["Now about sickness, people say that for sickness,","I have known people who are spiritualists,"]],[2588,["who try to cure."]],[2589,["But what they do is to remove one spirit and","put another one into it."]],[2592,["If a person, say, he is a person who is wasting","money, say in horse riding, so if you remove"]],[2599,["him from there, he'll become an alcoholic."]],[2601,["If not, he'll start beating his wife."]],[2603,["Because there is no transformation, you see."]],[2605,["There is a gap always if you ....so it is","better not to have some sort of a screw there"]],[2610,["which is always to be replaced by something","else."]],[2613,["So these spiritualists, also those who try","to heal, are just giving you relief in the"]],[2619,["physical being."]],[2620,["Physical being is not so important."]],[2621,["It is part of it but we are not only physical","beings."]],[2623,["We are also mental beings and emotional beings."]],[2626,["If you try to be only physical being, do everything","only for the physical side, then you forget"]],[2631,["the spirit."]],[2632,["And the spirits get angry with you."]],[2634,["So you are three of these things which are","to be integrated through your spiritual ascent."]],[2640,["All right?"]],[2641,["So that's why in any case that kind of a work","is of no help in any way to ask because ultimately"]],[2648,["we have to see to the general good of everyone","."]],[2653,["I have seen spiritualists who have been acting","as spiritualist end up their lives very miserably,"]],[2658,["most of them."]],[2660,["Not only that but whenever they are in a program","you get tremendous heat from them."]],[2666,["All those people who have tried such tricks..."]],[2667,["I'll give you a very good example of Doctor","[unclear: Lang or Land Side B 11:35], who"]],[2671,["was, who died - late Doctor [Unclear: Land","or Lang] International Curative Centre was"]],[2675,["in London, I don't know if it is still existing","or not."]],[2677,["I came to know about it because so many people","in India suffered from that curative center."]],[2682,["And they came to me."]],[2683,["I had no idea."]],[2684,["Now this gentleman died long time back and","his spirit entered into a soldier, not into"]],[2689,["his son, but to a soldier in Vietnam or something."]],[2691,["And this soldier, now they write all this","story, I mean they are very frank and honest"]],[2697,["- I must say they are not hiding anything."]],[2699,["So this gentleman came to England and told","the son that I am the father and he told him"]],[2704,["secrets where things are and all that and","he convinced him that he was the father."]],[2708,["He said that you open a clinic with this name","- Late Doctor [Unclear: Land or Lang] International"]],[2713,["Curative Centre."]],[2714,["Now what they used to do, you see, he got","hold of many doctors who were sort of unhappy"]],[2722,["or some sort of thing or those who were lingering","behind."]],[2725,["So, he used those spirits and what he did","by using those spirits, he used to write a"]],[2730,["letter, which I have seen myself, in many","cases, that at this time, at this hour, we"]],[2735,["will enter into your body."]],[2737,["I mean, they frankly told."]],[2738,["They didn't say that \"We are going to do anything","divine, and we'll enter into your body and"]],[2743,["when we enter into your body, then what will","happen, that you'll start shaking."]],[2747,["Don't be worried."]],[2748,["It is we who are in you, and once it happens,\"","- it would happen after three months or four"]],[2752,["months but they would give exact timing - \"and","then you'll feel better.\""]],[2756,["Now these people who came to me suffered from","tremendous nervous trouble."]],[2760,["And out of all these who came, even one percent","I could not cure - one percent."]],[2765,["They were such gone cases."]],[2767,["They had a miserable old age and I still know","of a lady; she just lays down in her bed and"]],[2773,["goes into tremors and things and nobody can","help her."]],[2777,["I haven't got time to pay so much attention","to one individual only."]],[2781,["So it's a miserable case."]],[2783,["Every time I go there, she meets me."]],[2786,["I put her right."]],[2787,["Again she goes back to her bed (and) again","she gets ill."]],[2791,["It's a very long process."]],[2795,["I am not here to cure you, I must tell you","very frankly, but to give you realization."]],[2800,["But as a by-product of that, you all get cured."]],[2803,["That's it."]],[2804,["Just as a by- product of that, you get cured."]],[2806,["Moreover, you must understand that God is","the source of all common sense."]],[2810,["He will only cure such lamps which will be","His lights later on because we don't look"]],[2815,["after lamps which are gone cases."]],[2817,["So they can be born again."]],[2819,["But God looks after those people who can give","His light to all."]],[2825,["Of course, many people get cured."]],[2826,["I have seen in London, the first wave of Sahaja","Yoga started - we have thousands of them they"]],[2831,["got cured."]],[2832,["But out of them very few really took up Sahaja","Yoga and helped others."]],[2836,["They just forgot."]],[2837,["Of course, they have tremendous respect for","Me."]],[2838,["When I go to India; they all fill the hall","and all that is there."]],[2841,["But they are doing nothing for Sahaja Yoga."]],[2843,["They are not doing anything curing for others."]],[2846,["They are not raising their Kundalini."]],[2847,["They are not giving realization."]],[2849,["It's really... sometimes I feel that so many","people have been cured, so much God has done"]],[2855,["for them, but they don't understand why God","has done it for them . It is to give it to"]],[2859,["others."]],[2860,["You don't have to do so much for Sahaja Yoga."]],[2861,["You don't have to pay a single pi [short form","of Paise]."]],[2862,["Nothing is needed."]],[2864,["Only thing is, God has given you this power."]],[2866,["All right, just give it to others."]],[2867,["That's all."]],[2868,["It's very simple."]],[2869,["And you feel so happy."]],[2871,["You are so employed by God that you do not","feel bored at all."]],[2875,["It's such a wonderful thing."]],[2876,["But one must accept that if He has been kind","to us we have to be kind to others."]],[2881,["It will just automatically work, no doubt."]],[2884,["It works."]],[2885,["I know people get cured, no doubt about it."]],[2889,["Any other question please?"]],[2890,["Yes, please - little loudly....can you say","loudly, please?"]],[2894,["Q. Why is the picture sitting on the table","lying next to you?"]],[2903,["Shri Mataji: Why?"]],[2908,["You don't like it?"]],[2911,["It's a question really something I can't understand."]],[2920,["You see, if I am something, if this picture","is My true picture, then why not have it?"]],[2927,["All the pictures you have of Christ are not","His own."]],[2929,["Very few people have seen Him and also there","is no one who has taken His picture."]],[2936,["Actually, when I see the pictures of Christ","I get a shock."]],[2939,["I said, \"How can this be Christ?\""]],[2941,["I mean, this miserable creature cannot be","Christ at all, but you don't mind having all"]],[2946,["these things around."]],[2947,["Even the cross that you have can be horrible,","made of plastic, made of this, made of that."]],[2953,["That gives horrible vibrations to you."]],[2955,["You don't know anything about it."]],[2957,["With this picture, you'll be surprised, the","person who first got realization got through"]],[2963,["this picture."]],[2964,["In this picture there are vibrations."]],[2966,["When you will get realized, you will know","that only this picture has that vibration"]],[2970,["because the real thing it is - thank God that","science has given us the real thing."]],[2974,["If there were cameras before, we would have","had pictures of all those great people."]],[2980,["Because there were no photographs they said,","\"Better not have any pictures.\""]],[2983,["Because all the pictures were imaginary, done","by people who wanted to have some money."]],[2988,["With this picture, many people have been cured."]],[2993,["All right?"]],[2995,["Especially in Australia, a miracle happened."]],[2998,["That's how media took me over."]],[3000,["There was a lady, a friend of a very big journalist","and a businessman there who was in coma and"]],[3008,["doctors said she has got a brain trouble and","she cannot come back to her normal condition."]],[3015,["There is a damage in her brain and she is","dying."]],[3019,["Then everybody had given up hopes and there","was one Sahaja Yogini and she said, \"All right,"]],[3023,["you just allow me to put this photograph under","her pillow.\""]],[3025,["And you'll be surprised: she came to consciousness","next day."]],[3028,["By the time I reached there, she was very","conscious."]],[3031,["So all the media was there to receive me in","Australia."]],[3034,["I was surprised because media is the last","which attends to anything that is real."]],[3038,["I was Myself aghast to see them there."]],[3042,["But it's one thing, no doubt, and it's really","true and it happened and now that woman is"]],[3046,["walking about."]],[3047,["You can write to her and find out."]],[3049,["So this is what it is."]],[3053,["It's a very good thing that has happened that","we can take pictures now because I think,"]],[3058,["I cannot meet everyone in this world but they","can at least see my picture."]],[3066,["People get cured by this picture."]],[3068,["What's wrong?"]],[3069,["Supposing your picture was like that, I would","like to put it there."]],[3072,["But is it like that?"]],[3074,["That's the point."]],[3075,["You see some people say, \"Why you are doing","it?\""]],[3077,["I say, \"Better you do it."]],[3078,["I would like to retire.\""]],[3079,["Actually, today my husband was very angry","with me."]],[3081,["He said, \"Why are you there on Saturdays?"]],[3083,["Why don't you come?\""]],[3084,["I said, \"Now it has been advertised too much."]],[3087,["I just can't come.\""]],[3088,["He is not, he wants me there for some purpose","and he was not very happy about it."]],[3092,["So I would be very happy if you could sit","down here and do the job."]],[3095,["You see, I'll be very happy."]],[3096,["I'll retire."]],[3097,["But you can't do it."]],[3098,["And why to feel bad if I can do it?"]],[3101,["Because you can do many more things that I","cannot."]],[3104,["For example, I can't drive, I don't know how","to write a check, I don't know anything that"]],[3109,["you know."]],[3110,["So many things there are that I do not know."]],[3111,["You'll be amazed."]],[3112,["I am so simple that people can call me a rustic","woman because I don't know many things that"]],[3117,["you know."]],[3119,["But I know one thing: that is awakening of","your Kundalini, and then another thing is"]],[3124,["that this photograph also knows you somehow."]],[3137,["Yes please?"]],[3142,["Q; How did you discover such a quick way of","self realization?"]],[3153,["Shri Mataji: Must be something about Me, sir."]],[3158,["You better find out."]],[3160,["It's true."]],[3161,["It's true."]],[3162,["But something about Me, definitely."]],[3164,["You see, whatever our education is, you have","come to us with wisdom and all that, it has"]],[3167,["come to us through other English writers and","western writers."]],[3171,["But if you really go into the literature,","you will know that it is already prophesized."]],[3178,["Even William Blake has prophesized absolutely","about Sahaja Yoga."]],[3181,["He said that God of men [men of god?] will","become prophets and they will have powers"]],[3187,["to make others prophets."]],[3189,["But who reads Blake?"]],[3191,["No one;they read Freud."]],[3193,["He's described to such a detail about Sahaja","Yoga that sometimes I am amazed."]],[3200,["No Indian seer has seen that what William","Blake has seen."]],[3204,["But our mentality is funny because once he","had his exhibition; I went to see his exhibition"]],[3212,["and people were looking at nude women that","he had painted."]],[3215,["He was innocent."]],[3216,["He didn't paint any nudity; he just painted","women without any dress, just the body."]],[3220,["But they were looking at the nude women."]],[3223,["So, look at our mentality."]],[3225,["Looking at William Blake also we praise him","because he has painted women without dress."]],[3233,["He was innocent."]],[3234,["It has to be done."]],[3235,["The time has come."]],[3237,["At the beginning of life, I know there were","hardly one or two people, but today is the"]],[3242,["time, a time where many have to become."]],[3247,["As you know, on the tree of life there were","few flowers."]],[3251,["Now there has to be many flowers because the","blossom time has come and it has to be simple."]],[3258,["But supposing it is simple, must you not accept?"]],[3262,["It's like my grandmother saying, \"I don't","believe you can go to moon."]],[3266,["How can it be possible?\""]],[3269,["It's like that."]],[3270,["It's a jet age."]],[3272,["If there is speed outside, if the tree is","growing outside too much, something must have"]],[3275,["grown inside: the roots."]],[3278,["And this is the knowledge of the roots which","you do not know, which you should know, how"]],[3283,["it has grown, what it is sucking."]],[3287,["All right?"]],[3288,["If it is so, why not have it?"]],[3290,["I mean, if I say there's a diamond, will you","refuse it?"]],[3293,["You'll say, \"All right, if it's diamond then","let us see.\""]],[3296,["It's more than all the diamonds put together."]],[3303,["It's true."]],[3305,["It is very simple to understand if you see","God's point of view."]],[3314,["This creation has to have a meaning."]],[3317,["And you are going to give it the meaning."]],[3319,["If it doesn't work out, this creation, it","is going to destroy, because human beings"]],[3323,["are going to be destroyed."]],[3327,["You can see that."]],[3329,["You can see around what is the situation is."]],[3337,["Q: [Unclear Side B 22:57]","Shri Mataji: It's a little confused question"]],[3385,["because, you see... but I understand what","you are trying to say, that people are seeing"]],[3393,["it through now because they are intelligent."]],[3396,["They are seeing through and it has reached","a certain culminating point, you see."]],[3399,["All these philosophies have reached certain","culminating point and they are seeing that,"]],[3405,["what is the result."]],[3406,["Now the time has come for them to see the","result of all their mental projections we"]],[3410,["have had about everything."]],[3411,["So people are thinking that there must be","an answer to all this."]],[3414,["Whatever we have done may have been little","wrong or something has been more linear."]],[3419,["It is not expanding us and it is not giving","us what was promised to us."]],[3423,["So they are thinking about it and they are","going down to find out the answers."]],[3427,["That's why there is a seeking, no doubt."]],[3429,["But it is also the plan that they should be","here, that they should be on this earth at"]],[3435,["this time."]],[3436,["All, so many things have worked out."]],[3437,["But the reason is that there is confusion","today."]],[3440,["In this confusion only, you are going to find","it out."]],[3443,["If you were not confused, if you were sure","that you are doing the right thing and you"]],[3447,["have done whatever is right which was before","this, then you would not have thought of it."]],[3452,["But just now people are seeing that we are","relatively living: \"This is also right."]],[3457,["This is also right.\""]],[3458,["How can that be?"]],[3459,["If right is one then it should be one."]],[3460,["So people are thinking about it."]],[3462,["They are seeking."]],[3463,["In this seeking they might do mistakes."]],[3465,["And people might do many mistakes like going","to wrong gurus, might spend money for it,"]],[3471,["may become bankrupts, might go to drugs, might","do this punk rock... all kinds of things."]],[3475,["They are nothing but expression of that feeling","within that there is something beyond."]],[3482,["It's true that this confusion has led to this","seeking."]],[3487,["No doubt about it."]],[3488,["Because they are all challenged."]],[3490,["These philosophies are challenged."]],[3491,["Everything is challenged."]],[3492,["And people see that it has given no result."]],[3495,["Our forefathers did the same; we are doing","the same."]],[3497,["What's the use?"]],[3498,["We have to reach somewhere."]],[3500,["For example, Jung has talked of universal","unconsciousness much before I came."]],[3506,["They have prepared the stage for Sahaja Yoga,","I should say."]],[3510,["All right?"]],[3513,["Q: [Unclear : something about another guru..."]],[3520,["Side B 25:51]."]],[3524,["Shri Mataji: Oh, now don't ask about them."]],[3530,["What do you think about him?"]],[3533,["What have they done?"]],[3535,["What good have they done to you?"]],[3540,["In general, there is one principle you must","apply to all of them."]],[3548,["On the gross, anybody who is interested in","your money is not your guru; he is a parasite,"]],[3554,["on the gross."]],[3555,["In the subtle, anybody who doesn't manifest","your powers has no powers of his own."]],[3565,["These two you apply to every guru and don't","ask Me individual question."]],[3568,["The one who is interested in Rolls Royce,","I mean if you think him to be a guru, I must"]],[3586,["say this is something surprising."]],[3589,["Very surprising."]],[3590,["It's a [not clear: sounds like paras attitude","Side B 26:52]"]],[3591,["Yes, he can... [probably Mother permitting","someone from the audience to ask a question]"]],[3632,["Q:[unclear question."]],[3633,["Sounds like: I wonder whether you have anything","in your faith which corresponds to the Apostles?"]],[3639,["In the Scriptures?"]],[3640,["Do you have any Apostles?"]],[3641,["Side B 27:46]","Shri Mataji:."]],[3642,["It's again confused, my child, but doesn't","matter."]],[3643,["Let's see now...they had a hot air on their","head."]],[3645,["Did you say so?"]],[3646,["When was it?"]],[3647,["Where was it written?"]],[3649,["You saw it in pictures?"]],[3652,["Reply : In the scriptures."]],[3655,["[unclear: Pentecost Side B 27:53]."]],[3659,["He sent out twelve men to do his work."]],[3663,["Shri Mataji: Yes, it's all right."]],[3664,["Now, I'll tell you what."]],[3665,["You see, hot air will come out of everybody's","head now."]],[3666,["Even you are sitting here."]],[3667,["Because there is heat within you."]],[3668,["First the hot air will come out."]],[3671,["You see, Christ tried to give them realization","but they didn't believe Him."]],[3675,["Believe me that they never believed Him till","he got His resurrection."]],[3679,["No, till they got His resurrection you see."]],[3681,["Till He got his resurrection, they were still","like this you see, little half baked, not"]],[3688,["fully there."]],[3689,["And that's why the hot air came out ."]],[3691,["You will see now, gradually as you'll settle","down in Sahaja Yoga, when you will be fully"]],[3696,["equipped, when your vibrations will flow well,","it will be cool breeze."]],[3699,["Otherwise, hot air comes out."]],[3701,["You see, with people who have..."]],[3703,["most of you will first have hot air, no doubt","about it because there is heat within you."]],[3706,["Now, I will tell you people very frankly about","it that when it is hot, say for example take"]],[3713,["Helium, Helium is a gas - you know that."]],[3716,["When it is hot, all the molecules in it fight","within, revolt against each other."]],[3722,["They are absolutely volatile."]],[3723,["But when it cools down, they become collective","and they move in a collective way."]],[3728,["Even in science it has been shown and it is","the cool breeze of the Holy Ghost which has"]],[3731,["been described in the Bible also."]],[3733,["So it should be a cool breeze because even","the Apostles that Christ had, they did not"]],[3739,["get their realization fully because they were","doubting Him."]],[3741,["Not doubting, I would say they did not have","that faith till they saw He was resurrected."]],[3746,["And after resurrection to have faith was rather","wrong, isn't it?"]],[3751,["Untimely, I should say."]],[3754,["I can understand that."]],[3757,["That time, you see, this was not there."]],[3759,["I mean, to talk of realization itself in that","country was something so out of the blue."]],[3764,["They were fishermen, not Cambridge students,","and you could not explain to them."]],[3769,["But still they were simple people and they","were honest, no doubt about it."]],[3774,["But to their honesty, they could not understand","how... what this man is saying about self-realization"]],[3779,["or of second birth, you see."]],[3780,["And so they doubted - was all right at that","time."]],[3782,["But today it is not all right because once","you get realization, you see for yourself."]],[3788,["All right?"]],[3789,["Q: [Unclear: also had this experience after","the resurrection Side B 30:10]"]],[3797,["Shri Mataji: You see, they had faith with","Him."]],[3800,["But I wouldn't say they got realization, except","for John, I would say; but others, I am not"]],[3805,["very sure."]],[3806,["Because the way they write about His works,","it's something an outsider writes, you see."]],[3811,["It's just a ... not a person who is innate."]],[3814,["You see, when they write, that's not there,","I find."]],[3817,["But the worst of all I feel is about St. Paul","who should not be there at all."]],[3820,["He had nothing to do with Christ."]],[3821,["I can't understand why he is there because","according to Sahaja Yoga standard, he was"]],[3825,["a supra-conscious personality."]],[3827,["I don't know why he put them there because","he saw a cross or he did all this."]],[3830,["He was the one who was killing all the Christians","to begin with and then suddenly, I don't know"]],[3834,["how - it was a Roman trick perhaps to put","him there - I don't know why but somehow I"]],[3838,["cannot explain it."]],[3840,["[Interruption by an audience - UNCLEAR Side","B 31:01]"]],[3845,["No, that's not the experience."]],[3848,["Experience is different."]],[3850,["The experience you can get it."]],[3852,["You see, the other day only one lady saw a","cross on me."]],[3855,["She saw auras."]],[3857,["Another one saw something else; that's not","the thing."]],[3860,["That's not reality."]],[3864,["Q: You are saying his experience did not exist","but yours is existing."]],[3866,["Shree Mataji: Yes, because that you can also","get an experience."]],[3868,["Supposing you are taking LSD; supposing, all","right?"]],[3870,["Anybody is taking LSD, they come and see Me."]],[3873,["They just see lights coming out of Me."]],[3875,["They don't see Me at all."]],[3877,["[Interruption UNCLEAR Side B 31:41]"]],[3879,["Shri Mataji: You see, you also are taking","too much time of others."]],[3882,["All right?"]],[3883,["Now leave it."]],[3884,["You come and see Me, we'll talk about it."]],[3889,["You see, we should see what have we got out","of it."]],[3891,["All these discussions and these dogmas - what","have you got?"]],[3895,["You see, what are we going to achieve out","of it?"]],[3900,["Just think of it."]],[3903,["What is the use?"]],[3905,["You have to get the reality."]],[3906,["Why discuss all these things?"]],[3907,["We have so many clergies here who have been","studying Bible and all that and they are now"]],[3910,["fed up."]],[3911,["Their heads are off now."]],[3912,["This dogma, that dogma, this, that - it's","over now."]],[3915,["Finish it."]],[3916,["Just get the reality first then we'll talk","about it."]],[3918,["All right?"]],[3919,["You just get the reality, then."]],[3921,["Q: [Unclear Side B 32:27]","Shri Mataji: Of course, that you will be in"]],[3928,["meditation."]],[3929,["You cannot meditate; you get into meditation."]],[3931,["That is the most meditative state."]],[3933,["Now, so I will tell you what happens to you,","all right?"]],[3935,["Let me talk on that."]],[3936,["That's a better question, a very good question."]],[3940,["First when the Kundalini rises - all right?","- you won't feel anything, most of you won't"]],[3948,["feel anything, but some of you may feel."]],[3950,["You may feel heat in the body."]],[3953,["You may feel kind of a, some people might","feel the throbbing in the back in the spinal"]],[3959,["cord, might feel, little, not much."]],[3962,["It's not very painful or anything."]],[3964,["Don't be frightened of anything."]],[3965,["Then it will rise."]],[3968,["Some of you might feel the rising, because","if there are obstructions you can feel the"]],[3972,["rising."]],[3973,["If there isn't any obstruction, if you are","not misidentified, if you are not extremist,"]],[3976,["if you are in the center, normally it shoots","off in the split of a second."]],[3981,["When it shoots off, what do you feel is, you","feel a cool breeze coming out of your head."]],[3987,["But normally, as I have seen, people are complicated."]],[3991,["There are complications in the physical, mental","or emotional being."]],[3994,["People are not so balanced."]],[3996,["Mostly they have liver problems or such things","like that."]],[3999,["You might get heat coming out."]],[4002,["First the heat comes; quite a lot of heat","might come."]],[4005,["When the heat disappears, then you start feeling","the cool coming and you feel very nice inside."]],[4009,["Then the bliss starts coming."]],[4012,["You start feeling absolutely relaxed and you","feel in your hands the cool breeze is coming."]],[4017,["But first of all you feel on the head."]],[4019,["You should feel yourself."]],[4021,["Nobody is going to certify it for you."]],[4022,["There is no falsehood about it."]],[4024,["It's a thing that you have to feel it."]],[4027,["And once it happens to you then you can develop","it."]],[4033,["Because though the Kundalini at the first","shot comes out but then She tries to look"]],[4038,["after your different organs if they are sick,","your mind if it is overloaded, or anything"]],[4045,["that is wrong it creates a balance [unclear","Side B 34:42]..."]],[4049,["So you have to just know how to reestablish","it yourself because it is your own."]],[4053,["Everything is your own."]],[4055,["It's - you can think like this that this light","is your own."]],[4058,["It is your own lamp."]],[4060,["I just have come because I have got the flame","in Me, perhaps."]],[4064,["Then I put the lamp."]],[4066,["Your light is enlightened."]],[4067,["Now you look after your light."]],[4069,["It's your light, it's everything yours."]],[4071,["The power is yours."]],[4072,["It's your mother."]],[4074,["It's your own spirit."]],[4077,["And then you work it out."]],[4079,["Unless and until you work it out, you will","not know whether it is true or not."]],[4087,["You have to work it out."]],[4088,["Now you should not be identified with anything,","that's one thing is true; because you have"]],[4093,["not seen the reality so far."]],[4094,["Say, for example, Mr X says, \"This one says","so.\""]],[4097,["All right, must have said it but he is not","here."]],[4101,["Today he is not here; it is I who am sitting","here."]],[4104,["All right?"]],[4105,["So it is better that what I am saying you","better receive it because it's nice to live"]],[4109,["with the past."]],[4110,["Like, people want to believe in the past because","it is easy to handle the past, or live with"]],[4116,["the future because it is easy, or live with","somebody who has written a book or something"]],[4119,["he had done to us."]],[4120,["But why not believe in yourself that so far","you have not got anything of your own and"]],[4126,["I am saying that you have to get it of your","own."]],[4130,["That's the main point I am trying to say,","that you must not believe into anything till"]],[4134,["you have found it yourself within your self."]],[4137,["That's what it is."]],[4138,["And if you are identified with other things","which you have been doing - most of the people"]],[4143,["who have paid to some Guru or some thing,","get very much identified with them."]],[4146,["But what have they given you?"]],[4148,["Have they given you any powers?"]],[4149,["Nothing."]],[4150,["Can you feel another person?"]],[4151,["In collective consciousness, you should be","able to feel another person."]],[4155,["After realization, immediately you can start","feeling another person and yourself."]],[4160,["Immediately you can feel, but you need sensitivity","which we lack quite a lot in the Western world"]],[4166,["because the [unclear sounds like 'light is","very small' Side B 36:36]."]],[4168,["But in India I have seen people get realization","(and) immediately they start feeling it like"]],[4172,["that."]],[4173,["It's very easy to cure Indians, I must say,","but difficult to cure Western people."]],[4178,["They are very complicated, ego-oriented, over-read,","all that is there."]],[4182,["But once the Western get it, they settle down","much faster, much better, much deeply than"]],[4187,["Indians do."]],[4188,["It's like if you have the teeth, you don't","have the food; and if you have the food, you"]],[4194,["don't have the teeth."]],[4195,["It's a funny combination, this world is."]],[4198,["Q: [unclear Side B 37:04]"]],[4201,["All right, let's have it."]],[4203,["Now see what sort of thing you work out in","Cambridge."]],[4208,["All right?"]],[4209,["So all of us should forget all about these","things."]],[4211,["Be honest to yourself and fair to yourself."]],[4214,["So far, by doing all these things you haven't","found yourself."]],[4217,["Accept this fact."]],[4218,["I have nothing to gain out of you."]],[4222,["I haven't even written a single line, a book,","nothing."]],[4228,["So you must know that it is your own."]],[4233,["I am just like a banker who is cashing your","checks."]],[4238,["Better have them cashed, for which you don't","have to pay anything."]],[4244,["You don't have to put in any effort, nothing."]],[4246,["But once you are realized then you will know","what is to be done."]],[4249,["But first get your lights on."]],[4251,["All right, now just co-operate with me as","I tell you, without much questioning."]],[4257,["I am not going to tell you anything horrid","nor am I going to trouble you by anything."]],[4265,["It is your own blessing just waiting at your","door step."]],[4267,["Can you believe Me now?"]],[4268,["If you can believe only this much that I am","genuine, it will work out."]],[4269,["May God bless you."]],[4270,["All right, now put your hands towards Me and","if it is not very inconvenient, please take"]],[4271,["out your shoes because this Mother Earth also","helps us."]],[4272,["It's better to take out your shoes; it helps."]],[4273,["If you are sitting on the ground, it's all","right."]],[4274,["You have to touch your Mother Earth with your","feet so if you can take out your shoes easily,"]],[4275,["it will work out faster."]],[4276,["Moreover, it is a very tight thing on the","feet."]],[4277,["Now this is the question of language of hands","which is an international language always,"]],[4278,["but this is the language where the hands get","enlightened and the hands have to speak."]],[4279,["As Mohammad Sahib has said it clearly, \"At","the time of resurrection, your hands will"]],[4280,["speak\"."]],[4281,["So, your hands have to speak and that's how","we have to see how our hands will be speaking."]],[4282,["So these centers which are shown here are","represented in your fingers."]],[4283,["So, these are five, six and seven, this side","left and right."]],[4284,["Once these centers are enlightened, then you","can feel yourself and feel others."]],[4285,["To begin with, we do not understand what it","is because it is too great a thing."]],[4286,["But once we start using it, we are amazed","how we start transforming, how things start"]],[4287,["happening to us."]],[4288,["All right, now just put your hands straight","like this."]],[4289,["Sit comfortably."]],[4290,["Be comfortable."]],[4291,["If you have anything tight, please make it","a little loose."]],[4292,["It's better."]],[4293,["Not that it makes any difference; it's very","subtle."]],[4294,["But why I am asking you because attention","goes there if it is something tight."]],[4295,["On the waist also if there is something tight","you see the attention is gone."]],[4296,["Make yourself comfortable."]],[4297,["That's the main point, be comfortable so that","for a while you could be with yourself comfortably."]],[4298,["If you are wearing any big malas and all that,","please take it out."]],[4299,["It's better."]],[4300,["It's heavy."]],[4301,["Anything like that, please take it out."]],[4302,["It will help us."]],[4303,["Just first get yourself realized and then","you start understanding."]],[4304,["Now, after this I have to tell you one more","thing that you have to keep your eyes shut."]],[4305,["The reason is that when the Kundalini rises","above this which it wants to pierce through,"]],[4306,["at that time it presses this point and the","pupils go into dilatation first before it"]],[4307,["is piercing it and that's why, if the eyes","are open and the Kundalini is passing through,"]],[4308,["She may stop."]],[4309,["So please keep your eyes shut, that's all."]],[4310,["Just keep your eyes shut till I tell you to","open them."]],[4311,["And if you have spectacles and all that, you","can also keep them safe because you don't"]],[4312,["have to see Me anymore till I ask you to open","your eyes."]],[4313,["So it's better to keep so that you don't have","problems of your spectacles."]],[4314,["Now close your eyes."]],[4315,["Now don't open your eyes as I requested you."]],[4316,["Please don't open your eyes, that's all."]],[4317,["Because this is just the opposite of hypnosis."]],[4318,["In hypnosis, they make you open your eyes","and put their eyes into your eyes and do all"]],[4319,["these things."]],[4320,["What's happening?"]],[4321,["Now, no gesticulations, nothing abnormal has","to be done."]],[4322,["Whatever has to happen will happen within."]],[4323,["Nothing abnormal thing has to be done."]],[4324,["Nobody has to jump, shout or scream - that's","all nonsense."]],[4325,["You are not to do anything like that, not","to turn your necks or anything."]],[4326,["Just keep quiet."]],[4327,["If you cannot keep quiet, it's better that","you go out for the time being."]],[4328,["But just keep quiet."]],[4329,["That's very important not to disturb others."]]]);
